    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For sister clades of equal genealogical depth, compare morphological or molecular disparity and assigned Linnaean ranks. Frequent large disparity and rank differences among equally related branches support the claim.";
